tallation has not been affected by the same physical phenomenon, during the last 24 months. Remission Physical Phenomenon in facilities of the same owner: There have been 17 failures in installations of the same owner with the same physical phenomenon, during the last 24 mobile months, corresponding to the Studies for Failure Analysis of the following table: FALLA_ID NAME_FALLA DATE_FALLA ACTIONS_CORRECTIVAS \u201cThe CGE Transmission S.A. indicates that \u201cthe EAF 129_20 unit was re","es":"Estudio para an\u00e1lisis de falla EAF 104/2025\n\u201cFalla en l\u00ednea 110 kV Cerrillos - Los Loros\u201d\nFecha de Emisi\u00f3n: 24-03-2025\n1. Descripci\u00f3n pormenorizada de la perturbaci\u00f3n\na. Fecha y Hora de la falla\nFecha 03/03/2025\nHora 14:27\nConsumos desconectados (MW) 5.14\nDemanda previa del sistema (MW) 11280.00\nPorcentaje de desconexi\u00f3n 0.046 %\nCalificaci\u00f3n Apag\u00f3n No aplica (porcentaje de desconexi\u00f3n < 10%)\nb. Identificaci\u00f3n instalaci\u00f3n afectada\nNombre de la instalaci\u00f3n L\u00ednea 110 kV Cerrillos - Los Loros / LT204CI1TR03----T0058\nTipo de instalaci\u00f3n L\u00ednea de transmisi\u00f3n\nTensi\u00f3n nominal 110 kV\nSegmento Dedicado\nPropietario instalaci\u00f3n afectada CGE Transmisi\u00f3n S.A.\nRUT 77.465.741-K\nRepresentante Legal Iv\u00e1n Quezada Escobar\nDirecci\u00f3n Av. Presidente Riesco N\u00b05561, piso 17, Las Condes\nc. Identificaci\u00f3n del elemento fallado\nNombre del elemento afectado L\u00ednea 110 kV Cerrillos - Los Loros / LT204CI1TR03----T0058\nPropietario elemento fallado CGE Transmisi\u00f3n S.A.\nRUT 76.411.321-7\nRepresentante Legal Iv\u00e1n Quezada Escobar\nDirecci\u00f3n Av. Presidente Riesco N\u00b05561, piso 17, Las Condes\nd. Origen y causa de la falla\nSe produjo la desconexi\u00f3n forzada de la l\u00ednea 110 kV Cerrillos - Los Loros, por operaci\u00f3n de las\nprotecciones del extremo Cerrillos, ante la presencia de una falla bif\u00e1sica.\nLa causa de la falla fue el choque de unas ruedas contra la estructura N\u00b038 de la l\u00ednea, provocando\nsu colapso, luego de que se desprendieran de un cami\u00f3n aljibe que circulaba a alta velocidad por la\nzona.\nd.2 Fen\u00f3meno F\u00edsico:\nACC3: Veh\u00edculos terrestres.\nLa empresa CGE Transmisi\u00f3n S.A. remite antecedentes para acreditar el origen de la falla.\nd.3 Reiteraci\u00f3n:\nReiteraci\u00f3n Fen\u00f3meno F\u00edsico en la instalaci\u00f3n afectada: Esta instalaci\u00f3n no ha sido afectada por el\nmismo fen\u00f3meno f\u00edsico, durante los \u00faltimos 24 meses m\u00f3viles.\nReiter","shown_language":"en","word_scores":[{"w":"study","s":0.09},{"w":"fault","s":0.45},{"w":"analysis","s":0.02},{"w":"eaf","s":0.05},{"w":"2025","s":0.21},{"w":"failure","s":0.11},{"w":"110","s":-0.36},{"w":"kv","s":-0.12},{"w":"los","s":0.11},{"w":"date","s":-0.04},{"w":"description","s":0.12},{"w":"date","s":-0.04},{"w":"time","s":-0.15},{"w":"failure","s":0.11},{"w":"date","s":-0.04},{"w":"03","s":-0.34},{"w":"03","s":-0.34},{"w":"2025","s":0.21},{"w":"time","s":-0.15},{"w":"14","s":-0.24},{"w":"consumptions","s":-0.12},{"w":"mw","s":0.15},{"w":"14","s":-0.24},{"w":"prior","s":0.15},{"w":"mw","s":0.15},{"w":"00","s":0.27},{"w":"percentage","s":0.13},{"w":"disconnection","s":0.05},{"w":"does","s":0.03},{"w":"apply","s":0.08},{"w":"percentage","s":0.13},{"w":"disconnection","s":0.05}]},"predictions":{"conflux":{"pred":"line_fault","probs":{"line_fault":0.9905,"breaker_fault":0.0037,"transformer_fault":0.0011,"busbar_fault":0.0047},"confidence":0.9905,"correct":true},"quorum":{"pred":"line_fault","probs":{"line_fault":0.6756,"breaker_fault":0.0778,"transformer_fault":0.0943,"busbar_fault":0.1523},"confidence":0.6756,"correct":true},"nexus":{"pred":"line_fault","probs":{"line_fault":0.6461,"breaker_fault":0.1185,"transformer_fault":0.1014,"busbar_fault":0.134},"confidence":0.6461,"correct":true}},"explanations":{"conflux":{"method":"Exact Shapley (Modality) + Gradient Attribution (Within